@startuml seq_vab_report
title VAB editor report: event-driven and 2 Hz dialog facts, cached, polled by revision
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
participant "GameEvents\n(editor, delta-v)" as Game
participant "EditorShipReport\nUnity main thread" as Addon
participant "ShipReportCache" as Cache
participant "kRPC server\nservice KSPHMI" as Krpc
participant "KrpcSource worker\nShipReportPoller" as HMI
participant "Display thread" as UI
activate Game
Game -> Addon : onEditorShipModified /\nonDeltaVCalcsCompleted
activate Addon
Addon -> Addon : collect ShipConstruct and\nVesselDeltaV into ShipFacts
Addon -> Cache : Publish(facts)
activate Cache
Cache --> Addon : true: text changed, revision + 1
deactivate Cache
Addon --> Game : handler returns
deactivate Addon
deactivate Game
activate HMI
HMI -> Krpc : KSPHMI.Revision()
activate Krpc
Krpc -> Cache : Revision
activate Cache
Cache --> Krpc : 58
deactivate Cache
Krpc --> HMI : 58
deactivate Krpc
alt revision differs from the last one fetched
  HMI -> Krpc : KSPHMI.ShipReport()
  activate Krpc
  Krpc -> Cache : Report
  activate Cache
  Cache --> Krpc : "v=1 rev=58 ..."
  deactivate Cache
  Krpc --> HMI : report text
  deactivate Krpc
  HMI -> HMI : parse_ship_report (rejects v != 1)
end
HMI -> HMI : publish Snapshot.ship
deactivate HMI
activate UI
UI -> UI : read latest Snapshot\ndraw the VAB report, or the static\ncards when Snapshot.ship is null
deactivate UI
note over HMI : Polled every 0.5 s while the context scene is vab.\nRpcError (no service, other scene): ship null, retry after 5 s.
note over Addon : RPCs never touch KSP objects:\nthey only read the cache.\nUpdate also polls crew, actions and cargo at 2 Hz;\nSAS/RCS requests stock panels on the Unity thread.
@enduml
